Cell["\<\
On the hexagon three lines pass through the edge from 1 to 2, not four. The \
line can end at 5 on one side and at 4 on the other, but not at both: 5, 6, \
1, 2, 3, 4 is not a shortest path:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"7a0421b0-c513-435d-8f29-99344b3aa815"],

